<p>French police rescued a nine-year-old boy in Hagenbach in eastern France after a neighbor reported hearing &quot;sounds of a child&quot; inside a utility van. Prosecutors said the boy&#x27;s father had locked him there since 2024. Officers forced open the vehicle and found the boy naked, malnourished, and unable to walk. They took him to a hospital and detained his father; The Guardian reported that he was later charged. The case has drawn attention across France because prosecutors described extreme conditions inside the van, including trash and excrement, and said the child had been confined there since 2024. The immediate news is that the boy is now receiving medical care and the justice system has stepped in — a reminder that one neighbor&#x27;s call can still lead to a lifesaving intervention.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/P2nxKwtDTiisZJno2RzVNk02LPtHfO5RbOufMwMld0v5M8a5u0z6l958EsH9EKFtQtaUbzHGFJXOoJU8fLKwXNw-9Bxog8tSc96SILYquZLdBLUIV0xQQ1sfwCXDzUBHGpnUl72rBR0N0ezuqG8rwj3bR7J8O7a7XPXdLdvkqQ' alt='' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Condition found: Police found the child lying in a fetal position under a blanket, on top of trash and near excrement, according to accounts citing the prosecutor&#x27;s statement.</li><li>Formal charges: The Guardian reported that authorities charged the father after the rescue, moving the case quickly from detention to formal criminal proceedings.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Neighbor: A resident alerted police after hearing what prosecutors described as &quot;sounds of a child&quot; coming from the van, prompting the rescue. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/11/french-man-charged-keeping-nine-year-old-son-locked-van-hagenbach'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Prosecutor Nicolas Heitz: He said the case involved prolonged confinement since 2024 and described the child&#x27;s condition when officers opened the vehicle. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3349763/french-police-find-naked-boy-9-locked-fathers-van-2024'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>Police: Officers forced open the utility van after getting the report, then took the child to a hospital and the father into custody. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/9-year-found-locked-utility-van-2024-malnourished-131946938'>ABC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/9-year-found-locked-utility-van-2024-malnourished-131946938'>9-year-old found locked in utility van since 2024, malnourished and unable to walk</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3349763/french-police-find-naked-boy-9-locked-fathers-van-2024'>French police find naked boy, 9, locked in father’s van since 2024</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/11/french-man-charged-keeping-nine-year-old-son-locked-van-hagenbach'>French man charged with keeping nine-year-old son locked in van since 2024</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/malnourished-french-boy-freed-from-van-he-was-locked-into-by-father-since-2024-11344595#publisher=newsstand'>Malnourished French Boy Freed From Van He Was Locked Into By Father Since 2024</a> - ndtv.com</li></ul>